所以你只能接受现实。

1738
01:04:23.640 --> 01:04:26.220
Both Jim and Pam are saying to others,
吉姆和帕姆都在这一集中给别人提建议，

1739
01:04:26.340 --> 01:04:28.260
they're giving advice to others in this episode.
他们都在给别人出主意。

1740
01:04:28.740 --> 01:04:30.400
Pam gives advice to Dwight.
帕姆给德怀特提了建议。

1741
01:04:30.480 --> 01:04:34.180
And she says something where it's just Pam projecting.
她说的话其实就是帕姆自己的投射。

1742
01:04:34.560 --> 01:04:34.660
Yeah.
没错。

1743
01:04:34.760 --> 01:04:37.040
Where she says, you know, it's just,
她说，你知道，就是，

1744
